    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105327" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῐτημόρι-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ον </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		v. infr.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>equal
				to a third part,</i> c. gen., 
