					Hdt.
					1.192
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τριτημόριος [δίεσις</span>]
				<i><span class="en">
				Cleonid.
				<u>Harm.</u>
				7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος τ.</span>”
				<i>a ratio of</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			:<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theo Sm.
				p.76H.
			</span></i>
		</div>
